    "text": "Two cars <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;are moving with a speed of <math><mn>15</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mn>5</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and acceleration of the cars are&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> respectively. Then the minimum separation between them is<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/16705959-f468-4908-874d-26f54bf29f82.png\" style=\"width:4.17708in;height:0.93609in\" />",
